  "goodToKnow": "Der Kristall is a crystal: Eiskristalle, Salzkristalle. Das Kristall (neuter) is crystal glass: Gläser aus Kristall. Kristallklar means crystal clear. The Nazi pogrom of 9 November 1938 was long called Kristallnacht or Reichskristallnacht, a euphemism for the broken glass; today Novemberpogrome is preferred. Swarovski crystal is from Austria. Plural: die Kristalle."
